# reset must stop before it overwrites an untracked file.
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "adds f"
<<<
> rm f.txt
<<<
> commit "removes f"
<<<
+ f.txt notwug.txt
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
removes f

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
adds f

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*
D UID1 "${2}"
> reset ${UID1}
There is an untracked file in the way; delete it, or add and commit it first.
<<<
= f.txt notwug.txt
